; Numbers the core accepts but whose products leave Decimal's range. The
; plugin must not panic, and must not pass them silently: the share count
; is still checked (line 12), and an assignment whose basis cannot be
; computed is reported as not checked (line 19).
plugin "beancount_options.check_option_assignment"
2026-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2026-01-01 open Assets:Opt
2026-01-01 open Equity:X
2026-09-03 * "STO"
  Assets:Opt  -1000000000000000000000000 AAPL261016P99999999 {1 USD}
  Equity:X
2026-10-16 * "assigned, 1 share delivered for 10^24 contracts"
  Assets:Opt 1000000000000000000000000 AAPL261016P99999999 {}
  Assets:Stock 1 AAPL {1 USD}
  Equity:X
2026-09-03 * "STO"
  Assets:Opt  -1000000000000000000000000 MSFT261016P99999999 {1 USD}
  Equity:X
2026-10-16 * "assigned, strike x shares out of range"
  Assets:Opt 1000000000000000000000000 MSFT261016P99999999 {}
  Assets:Stock 100000000000000000000000000 MSFT {1 USD}
  Equity:X
